// BT-3738 (ADR 0131 Phase 3): the statement-position matrix cells that
// answered wrong, raised or failed to compile before conditionals became
// local-threading producers (`adr0131_statement_probes.tsv`, verdict `bad` or
// `over`, now `ok`). Each method is one cell of the matrix: a construct
// (`kind`) writing the method-level local `t` (`target`) inside a block role
// (`container`), in a class, value-type or actor method. `c` is the
// condition. The expected answers are in stdlib/test/adr0131cond_matrix_test.bt.

TestCase subclass: Adr0131CondMatrixTest

  testClassArmCvarDo =>
    self assert: (Adr0131CondMatrixClass armCvarDo: true) equals: 3
    self assert: (Adr0131CondMatrixClass armCvarDo: false) equals: 0

